<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Honda (1971) J. Theor. Biol. & Honda & Fisher (1978) Science 3D recursive dichotomous tree branching, effective leaf area optimization, and Leonardo da Vinci pipe-model cross-sectional area conservation (Cornus controversa (Pagoda dogwood / wedding cake tree) & Terminalia catappa (Tropical almond pagoda tree))",
        "Honda (1971) J. Theor. Biol. & Honda & Fisher (1978) Science 3D recursive dichotomous tree branching, effective leaf area optimization, and Leonardo da Vinci pipe-model cross-sectional area conservation faithfully reproduces Cornus controversa (Pagoda dogwood / wedding cake tree) & Terminalia catappa (Tropical almond pagoda tree) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 1976-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Cornus controversa (Pagoda dogwood / wedding cake tree) & Terminalia catappa (Tropical almond pagoda tree) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 52.0/100, audit 2026-10-19-dichotomous-tree-branching-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/1976-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching.py> ;
    schema:about "Cornus controversa (Pagoda dogwood / wedding cake tree) & Terminalia catappa (Tropical almond pagoda tree)" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/1976-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching.py; output: docs/media/dichotomous_tree_branching_comparison.png; organism: Cornus controversa (Pagoda dogwood / wedding cake tree) & Terminalia catappa (Tropical almond pagoda tree); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: eda105b6a09bddde8549d14c48bd6a5e37008bf9238b3585daf3bc48336da26b; artifact_sha256: dad80c3426bb4219912d67817048ba6d8b2c74120493777eb856f243f74dff0d; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/dichotomous_tree_branching/cornus_controversa_tiered_crown_specimen.jpg=47cbd7225997789e..., datasets/dichotomous_tree_branching/dichotomous_tree_branching_reference.json=9b8cd89b9fa19fbf...}" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1002/j.1537-2197.1979.tb06267.x>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-5193(71)90031-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.107.258101>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.199.4331.888>,
        <https://doi.org/10.18960/seitai.14.3_97> ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-model-fidelity>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-morphometric-validation>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-overall>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-parameter-expressivity>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-repro-package>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-source-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-specimen-match> ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-dichotomous-tree-branching-audit-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-dichotomous-tree-branching-audit-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-2> ;
    pk:hypothesisType "3D Recursive Dichotomous Tree Vector Rotation, Effective Canopy Leaf Area Optimization & Leonardo da Vinci Pipe-Model Area Conservation" ;
